---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="JTAPS Winterland Bar - Seasonal Decor, Favorites, and Rewards"
  description="Step into JTAPS Winterland Bar for seasonal decor, your favorite menu items, and a cozy sports bar vibe in Cincinnati."
  keywords="winterland bar cincinnati, seasonal bar decor, sports bar winter theme, jtaps bar and grill, cincinnati winter bar"
  ogImage="/images/Winterland.jpg"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://jtapsbarandgrill.com" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Blog", "item": "https://jtapsbarandgrill.com/blog" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Winterland Bar", "item": "https://jtapsbarandgrill.com/blog/winterland-bar" }
      ]
    }
  </script>
  <article class="blog-post">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/blog">Blog</a> / <span>Winterland Bar</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="post-header">
      <h1>JTAPS Winterland Bar: Step Into the Season</h1>
      <div class="post-meta">
        <span class="post-date">February 9, 2026</span>
        <span class="post-author">JTAPS Team</span>
        <span class="post-category">Seasonal</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <img src="/images/Winterland.jpg" alt="JTAPS Winterland Bar theme" class="featured-image" />

      <section>
        <h2>Your Winterland Bar in Cincinnati</h2>
        <p>
          This season, JTAPS Bar and Grill transforms into a Winterland Bar with warm lighting, festive decor,
          and the same game day energy you love. If you are looking for a cozy spot to catch the game, meet
          friends, or unwind after work, our Winterland theme makes every visit feel like a night out.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Stop In Today for Your Favorites</h2>
        <p>
          Winter vibes pair perfectly with our JTAPS favorites. Order famous Pete's Sauce wings, hand-carved
          gyros, juicy burgers, and ice-cold drinks while you watch the action on 50+ TVs. Whether you come
          for lunch, dinner, or a big game, the Winterland atmosphere makes it even better.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Wings:</strong> Classic, crispy, and sauced just right</li>
          <li><strong>Gyros:</strong> Hand-carved and loaded with flavor</li>
          <li><strong>Burgers:</strong> Juicy, stacked, and made to order</li>
          <li><strong>Drinks:</strong> Cold beers, bourbon, and seasonal pours</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Make Every Visit Count with Rewards</h2>
        <p>
          JTAPS Rewards makes every visit more rewarding. For every $150 you spend, you get $10 in rewards,
          plus birthday and sign up bonuses. Join today and start earning right away.
        </p>
        <div class="rewards-cta">
          <a
            class="rewards-primary"
            href="https://loyalty.focuspos.com/addmember/?C=2786"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
          >
            Sign Up for Rewards
          </a>
          <a
            class="rewards-secondary"
            href="https://loyalty.focuspos.com/base/?C=2786"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
          >
            Check Your Points
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>See the Winterland Theme for Yourself</h2>
        <p>
          The Winterland Bar is here for a limited time. Come experience the decor, grab your favorite menu
          items, and enjoy the full JTAPS sports bar vibe. We will save you a seat.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="post-footer">
        <p><strong>JTAPS Bar and Grill</strong> | 6441 Glenway Ave, Cincinnati, OH 45211 | (513) 574-9777</p>
        <p>Winterland Bar Theme • 50+ HD TVs • Famous Wings • Great Drinks</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: #E13622;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .blog-post {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .post-header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #E13622;
    padding-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .post-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .post-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .post-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #333;
  }

  .featured-image {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .post-content h2 {
    color: #1a1a1a;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin: 30px 0 15px;
  }

  .post-content ul {
    margin: 15px 0 20px 20px;
  }

  .rewards-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .rewards-cta a {
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .rewards-primary {
    background: #E13622;
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 18px rgba(225, 54, 34, 0.25);
  }

  .rewards-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: #E13622;
    border: 2px solid #E13622;
  }

  .rewards-cta a:hover,
  .rewards-cta a:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .post-footer {
    margin-top: 50px;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .post-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .post-content h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
